{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0062_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "d34b57f592ab8e0487a87eb1fba3038c9a3ab523fdcaadf498bf41766d74a7a4", "ja": "自分、歌とダンスだけじゃなくて、演技でもみんなを\nビックリさせたいって思ってたんだ。だから……。", "zh": "本人不想光靠唱歌跟跳舞，\n还想用演技来惊艳大家，所以才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
